{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34714","headline":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平入声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"夏日闲居作四声诗寄袭美 平入声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"端居愁无涯，一夕髪欲白。\n因爲鸾章吟，忽忆鹤骨客。\n手披丹台文，脚着赤玉舃。\n如蒙清音酬，若渴吸月液。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}